(7768990, 1289138, 30861, '<td valign="top">
In principle, I like the way you''ve approached exposure and tonality here very much. But I have to be honest: I don''t think I''ve ever seen a more static depiction of a rodeo event. It''s not that you''ve *frozen* everything, because that is a valid approach. No, it''s that the composition is too danged static for such a robust, energetic event.</td>', 'In principle, I like the way you''ve approached exposure and tonality here very much. But I have to be honest: I don''t think I''ve ever seen a more static depiction of a rodeo event. It''s not that you''ve *frozen* everything, because that is a valid approach. No, it''s that the composition is too danged static for such a robust, energetic event.', '2024-08-15 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
