(7769321, 1289567, 30049, '<td valign="top">
Love watching herons hunt/stalk for food.  So stealthy and dedicated to their mission.  This may be one of the blueist (sp?) herons I''ve seen.  We get them at our pond once in a while, but it''s darn near impossible to get close enough for a photo.  Best place for us is at the river, where you can get a little closer.  Not quite the intimate setting like this one though.  
<br/>
<br/>You could add an extender to that 200/2.8 and still get a fair amount of light.  A 1.4x would give you 280/F4 (I think).  Just a thought.</td>', 'Love watching herons hunt/stalk for food.  So stealthy and dedicated to their mission.  This may be one of the blueist (sp?) herons I''ve seen.  We get them at our pond once in a while, but it''s darn near impossible to get close enough for a photo.  Best place for us is at the river, where you can get a little closer.  Not quite the intimate setting like this one though.  

You could add an extender to that 200/2.8 and still get a fair amount of light.  A 1.4x would give you 280/F4 (I think).  Just a thought.', '2024-08-22 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
