(7769366, 1289545, 3306, '<td valign="top">
When I saw this image I found it very interesting and very well composed. The subject ,alignment, DOF and processing in B&amp;W are all excellent.  I do not care for the exposure time as the sky is almost dizzying and takes away from the sharpness of the entire image. In order to g et a better feeling of the movement of the clouds I would have suggested a longer exposure time which is difficult when it is very light out. Of course if you like the clouds the way they are that is all that counts! Just my opinion:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2024-08-23 08:57:05.</i></td>', 'When I saw this image I found it very interesting and very well composed. The subject ,alignment, DOF and processing in B&W are all excellent.  I do not care for the exposure time as the sky is almost dizzying and takes away from the sharpness of the entire image. In order to g et a better feeling of the movement of the clouds I would have suggested a longer exposure time which is difficult when it is very light out. Of course if you like the clouds the way they are that is all that counts! Just my opinion:)', '2024-08-23 08:55:31.000000', '2024-08-23 08:57:05.000000', 0),
